<title>NEW ZEALAND: Westpac Investments reduces PFI stake.</title>
<headline>Westpac Investments reduces PFI stake.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Investment Management said on Tuesday it had reduced its stake in Property for Industry to 29.75 percent from 31.19 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
